\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-- \*\*Stage 5: Multi-Objective
Ranking and Delivery\*\* All candidates that pass the simulation stack
receive a comprehensive multi-objective score and are ranked from best
to worst across all dimensions. The number of candidates delivered is
not fixed \-\-- it is determined by how many pass all quality
thresholds, which could be four or forty depending on the disease.
\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\--
\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\--
