\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-- \*\*PART 10: THE TECHNOLOGY
ARCHITECTURE\*\* INTERCEPTA is built by connecting existing validated
tools through an intelligent integration and ranking layer. We do not
rebuild molecular simulation. We do not rebuild protein structure
prediction. We use the best tools that exist and add what only we can
add: the net approach, the KAALCURA sensitivity layer, and the
two-population ODE dynamics. \*\*10.1 Technology Stack\*\*
